WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:39.030
<b>Shinozuka-san, Sugar Content, and the Press Conference</b>

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:37.720
And then my dad also wanted one,

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:39.980
so he built a smoker in our yard.

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:43.370
He smoked some salmon, and every 
cat in the neighborhood came by.

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:44.450
Next thing we knew, over half—

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:45.370
U-Um!

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:47.610
Jeez, you scared me!

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:49.180
Momo-senpai?

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:51.490
I'm sorry to do this out of 
the blue, but you see...

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.760
You want to talk to us about something?

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.850
Yes, um...

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.180
This is something only you two can do...

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:04.780
What?! Does this involve Gotou-sensei?

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:07.270
Y-Yes. How did you know?

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.690
Don't tell me... you're going 
to confess your love for him!

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:14.190
A-Actually, I want to buy and 
immediately eat some sweets.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:16.660
Say what?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:20.100
What's that got to do with Gotou-sensei?

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.450
Well, you see...

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:27.290
Sensei, all these sweets were thrown 
away in the corner of the courtyard.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:31.540
If they were going to eat these in a group, 
they should've just gone to someone's house.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.880
Why bother eating them at school?

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:35.750
I'm sure it's similar

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:41.720
to how the more people need to get up, 
the more they just want to sleep in.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:47.100
R-Right...

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:53.110
I ended up acting like I knew what 
Gotou-sensei was talking about...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.840
<i>Yeah, that analogy sucked.</i>

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:57.940
I thought about it long and hard later,

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:01.590
and I thought he meant that 
I could possibly understand

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:05.870
what the other students were feeling 
if I also broke the rules...

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.750
But I can't allow myself to 
eat sweets in the courtyard,

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.800
so I thought I'd buy and eat some 
sweets on the way to school...

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.290
but, um...

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:17.960
I can't seem to find the 
courage to do it alone...

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.640
Got it!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.910
Leave this to us.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:28.350
But really, you're pretty 
amazing, Momo-senpai.

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:32.130
You're willing to break the 
rules for the person you love.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:34.150
Wh-Why are you saying it like that?

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.400
And I'm not that much 
of a goody-two-shoes...

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.840
Where should we go? Inoyama?

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:41.740
Yeah.

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:50.330
M-Miyamo-san... Nonomura-san...

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.460
That... qualifies as property damage!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.220
You shouldn't pick flowers 
from someone else's yard!

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:01.630
But we've been picking and sucking the 
flowers from here since we were little.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.500
It's so yummy!

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.300
Right?

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.950
Let me go ask real quick.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.150
She said it's fine.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:08.760
Huh?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.520
Um, I, um...

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:16.610
Momo-senpai! You want to try 
sucking one, too, don't you?

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:21.360
Don't move. We'll consider this an 
appetizer for the upcoming sweets.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.110
I-I couldn't!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:27.200
It's fine. This is all our doing.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:33.370
It's so sweet!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.750
M-Momo-senpai?

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:39.790
Wowie! I never knew the nectar 
from flowers was so sweet!

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:43.510
It's so aromatic, and the 
flavor is so profound!

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:47.430
I almost feel like a honey... bee...

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:53.720
N-Now I've done it...

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:56.060
<i>Wait. Did she sound slightly 
different just now?</i>

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.480
<b>Huh...</b>

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.670
I guess you have a real 
sweet tooth, Momo-senpai.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:01.870
Who would've thought?

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:05.400
Yes... It's beyond a sweet tooth. 
I mean, you saw what happened.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:10.660
Even my family gets weirded out,
 so I can only eat sweets at home alone.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.580
<i>She acts like that by herself?</i>

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.130
The reason I asked you two to come with me

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:18.630
is also to have you stop me 
if I do anything weird

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.800
after buying and consuming the sweets.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.720
Then why don't you eat snacks that
aren't sweet, like rice crackers?

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.550
<i>I guess she'd rather just eat sweets.</i>

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:36.980
<b>Inoyama Shop</b>

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.950
It's that shop right over there.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.980
It's not on the way to our school, 
so you won't see any of our students there.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.680
You can eat while you're in the store, too.

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:42.440
Wow, I've never been to such a place.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.920
I told you. I'm watching 
the store for Grams today,

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.410
and these shops open early.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.720
Pardon me.

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:52.620
I've got a customer.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.740
End Call

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.740
Hello, there.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:56.160
I'd like these, please.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.830
<b>Milk</b>

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.630
<i>What's up with this girl? That bloodlust...</i>

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.160
I'd like these, please.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.460
<i>At least she's normal.</i>

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:17.880
I will now make my first-ever attempt at 
consuming sweets right after buying them.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:18.650
Okay!

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:25.480
<i>Gotou-sensei, please forgive me.</i>

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:33.580
<b>Let's do this!!</b>

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:33.580
<b>Chihuahua
Sauce</b>

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.090
Here I go.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:32.190
<i>I've never seen someone undo 
the wrapper so delicately.</i>

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.120
Go!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.580
<i>What the heck?</i>

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:37.370
If I lose myself like I did earlier,

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.620
please stop me, even if you have to hit me.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.290
Promise me you will.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:42.250
Got it!

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:52.930
This is... I see... It's a bit different 
from regular chocolate.

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:57.700
So yummy!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:03.020
This sweetness that hits you before 
the aroma of the cacao is fantastic!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:04.770
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:07.470
Plus it's only ten yen, 
and there's even a biscuit inside!

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:09.570
This is indeed a surprise!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.910
And to finish it all off, this butteriness

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.120
is a sweet surprise! 
Because you know... sweets!

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:19.810
This sensation of the caramel 
getting stuck in your teeth!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:22.420
It's been too long!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.290
<i>Oh, I get it.</i>

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.380
<i>This is how Momo-senpai is normally.</i>

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.370
If I say anything strange, please stop me.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:35.680
<i>This reminds me of the time a Western 
horror game was released in Japan...</i>

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.980
<i>Because the Japanese distributor 
decided to censor it,</i>

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.780
<i>Wait, stop! Wh-What are you doing?!</i>

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:41.520
<i>most of the super violent 
scenes were completely black.</i>

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.520
What the hell is going on?!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:45.750
<i>Is there ever a reason to simply put 
a lid on something that stinks?</i>

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.360
<i>No... If this is Momo-senpai's true form...</i>

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:51.610
<i>Then...</i>

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.100
<i>Then...</i>

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.030
These sweets are so damn good!

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:00.390
Have a taste, Momo-senpai!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.850
What? Really?!

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:02.620
But of course!

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:06.790
Wh-What is this?! It's so sweet and sour!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:07.410
I know, right?!

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.460
Have another!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.090
<i>U-Uh...</i>

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:13.970
The contrasting texture between 
the wafers and cream is superb!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.910
These banana things are awesome! 
Om nom nom nom nom...

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.600
I love those, too!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.680
<b>Cherry</b>

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.680
<b>Melon</b>

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.680
<b>Watermelon</b>

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:21.680
I'll just have to do the forbidden 
"three flavors at once" technique!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.270
<b>Watermelon</b>

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.270
<b>Melon</b>

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:23.270
<b>Cherry</b>

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.940
<i>Hokkaido... The inside of 
my mouth is now Hokkaido...</i>

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:29.860
Momo-senpai, we're about 
to run out of sweets!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.860
Very well! I will allow you to buy more!

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:37.370
U-Um... these... here.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:39.660
<i>Oh, she sort of returned to normal.</i>

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.120
Senpai, here are the relief supplies!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.080
Excellent work!

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.760
We'll put this cola powder 
into the cola, and...

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.710
The perfect cola is now complete!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.050
<i>It's so sweet!</i>

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:58.790
Have a taste, you two!

00:08:58.790 --> 00:08:59.850
Thanks!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.000
So sweet!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.060
I know, right?!

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:07.130
Please give us some kind of prize 
for this unprecedented invention!

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:08.480
In that case...

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.940
Have the Nobel Fizzy Drink Prize!

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.240
I'm allowed to have such an honor?

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:15.900
Congrats!

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:19.680
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.080
I'm the recipient of the 
Nobel Fizzy Drink Prize,

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.110
and my name is Shinozuka Momo!

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.000
Whoa! It's a press conference 
for the award ceremony!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.770
How will you use this 
technology in the future?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:27.920
<b>Air Mic</b>

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:31.750
Well, I plan to develop 
this technology even further,

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:37.590
and one day, I'll marry Gotou-sensei!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.010
<b>Marr</b>

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:37.590
<b>Marriage</b>

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:43.890
Why didn't you stop me?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.140
Because you looked so happy, Momo-senpai.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:50.400
So how was your first experience 
buying and consuming?

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:54.320
Well, i-i-it was...

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.490
so much fun!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.790
Huh?! Wh-Why are you crying?!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.860
Thinking about how I'll never 
be able to do it again is just...

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:07.340
Then let's have a sweets party 
at your house sometime, Senpai.

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.090
What? Really?

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:17.090
I'm sorry, Gotou-sensei, 
to ask for a day off without warning.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:20.010
Don't be. It's good to 
let loose once in a while.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:26.600
Um, I... think I understand now.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.520
I smell chocolate, cola, and caramel.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.440
<b>Chio's</b>

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.440
School Road

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.440
<i>Chio's School</i>...

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.440
What are your thoughts on mint chocolate?

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.360
Huh? Mint chocolate?

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:44.190
I think people are rather 
split on it overall,

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:45.660
but I love it. I find it refreshing.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:50.000
So there <i>is</i> someone who likes it!

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:58.300
<b>Thousand Spring</b>

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.350
Hey! It's that girl!

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.070
<i>Gotta contact Manana.</i>

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.010
<i>Her uniform...</i>

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:18.320
<i>She's headed in a different direction 
than her school, Eihei Girls' Academy.</i>

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.740
<i>She must be scheming something...</i>

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.580
Damn it. There's still some left in here.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:29.520
Honestly, what if it explodes in the truck?

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:32.460
And there's a bottle right next to it.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:36.840
To think that I hadn't even thrown out 
trash from my own place until recently...

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:39.550
The bottles go with the bottles! 
The cans go with the cans!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.220
Whoa! A stuffed animal! Creepy!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.300
<b>Extra Large
Portions</b>

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.300
<b>Plain Jane
with Glasses
220 minutes</b>

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:48.220
<i>Plain Jane... with Glasses</i>... 220 minutes!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.550
I wonder if this is still watchable.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:53.350
No, I... But maybe just a little...

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.650
No, I'm throwing it away!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:55.900
Ow!

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:57.200
What the...

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.660
Chiharu!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.400
Huh? What are you doing here?

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:04.200
What the hell are you doing here, Mayu-nii?

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.660
Huh? I'm working my shift 
at the convenience store.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.370
Stop working!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:09.660
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:12.520
I thought you were going to be the 
world's best motorcycle gang member!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:10.200
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:10.700
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:11.200
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:11.700
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:12.200
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:12.700
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:13.960
Yeah, but...

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:13.200
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:13.710
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:13.960
<b>Bonk</b>

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.710
Stop working! It's so lame!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:19.260
When you had your team, 
you were so cool!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:21.470
<b>Starry Night Squad</b>

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:21.700
You always smelled like blood and steel! 
I looked up to you!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.760
Now look at you!

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:28.600
You've never even taken 
the garbage out at home!

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:28.600
C-Calm down! Okay?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:32.640
Why the hell am I going to 
private school to study?!

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.980
A-Andou-san...

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:37.440
Do you know her?

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.780
Yeah. She's my—

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:42.700
Hey! Calm down!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.180
This is Andou Chiharu.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:47.070
She's my sister, and she's 
ten years younger than me.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.990
What?! You know Mayu-nii?

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:52.450
Wait, you know Chiharu, Miyamo?

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.580
She stuck her fingers up my ass 
out of nowhere the other day.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:56.080
The hell?!

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.300
What do you think you're doing?!

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:00.880
I didn't just do it randomly. We were 
engaging in actual ass-to-ass combat.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.460
The one who has to clean up 
after flower arrangement class

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.610
is always decided during 
lunch with ass-to-ass combat.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.720
I can't tell if this is supposed 
to be elegant or vulgar...

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:10.260
So why are you going after Miyamo?

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.350
Why?

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:14.350
To find your woman.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:18.310
It was completely unnatural for you 
to just up and leave your team,

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:20.650
so I gathered some information myself.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.970
The hell you want, you stupid little brat?

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.150
I'm Andou's little sister!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.280
What happened to my brother?

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:31.290
Tell me now!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.740
A-A woman from Samejima—

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.460
You dumbass! You're gonna get killed!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.330
But...

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.210
Sorry, but we can't say anything.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:43.090
<i>Samejima? A woman from Samejima Academy?</i>

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.930
<i>Then I'm going to find this bitch...</i>

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.390
<b>Kill her</b>

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:48.390
<i>and kill her.</i>

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.110
<i>Uh, kill her?</i>

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.990
I targeted this four-eyes 
here to use as a pawn

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.730
so I could find that woman, 
since they go to the same school.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.340
Hey, Chiharu, listen...

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.190
You don't have to hide it. I know!

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:02.680
<i>Uh... She's got quite a 
few things wrong here,</i>

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:05.280
<i>but she's essentially looking for me, isn't she?</i>

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:11.410
Soft
Serve

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.550
<i>I thought everything was 
settled with Andou-san,</i>

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.410
<i>and I doubt anything good will 
come of telling her it's me, so...</i>

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.930
<b>Not my
problem</b>

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:12.910
<i>Not my problem.</i>

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.690
<i>You can take care of it.</i>

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.500
Well, you see...

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:21.330
I get it. It was amazing, right?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.340
Y-Yeah.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:25.670
It was so amazing that you 
even changed your lifestyle.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.630
That s*x...

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:34.720
She's like a succubus who lives at 
a love hotel... and Mayu-nii, you...

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.930
Who are you calling a succubus?!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:40.050
That reaction... You must be Mayu-nii's woman!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:41.980
We're not going out! And I'm a virgin!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.150
Chiharu! Where did you learn such language?!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.800
Also, why do you keep calling him Mayu-nii?!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:50.110
<b>Soft Serve Deluxe</b>

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.870
Oh, my name's Mayuta...

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.110
I see!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:54.120
What? So this four-eyes here 
took you out in a single blow?

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:57.960
That's right. As you mentioned, 
I ended up losing in a duel with her.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:00.680
I quit the team because of 
the promise I made then.

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:01.640
That's all.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.250
Yeah, I guess it's something like that...

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.760
I can't accept that!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:07.920
Chiharu!

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.930
Do my eyes look like they're lying?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:15.330
N-No, but...

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.020
Th-Then prove it to me!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.810
I simply can't believe that she 
took you out with one punch!

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.190
If she does it right in front 
of me, then I'll believe it.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:27.110
But I'm pretty sure four-eyes 
over there can't do it!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:27.900
Chiharu!

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:32.280
<i>You're not actually saying you 
want Miyamo to hit me, are you?</i>

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.670
Andou-san...

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.160
Miyamo...

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:36.540
Fight!

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.460
What?! Are we seriously doing this?

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.460
Of course we are!

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:43.060
I can't let this end with your little 
sister treating me like some slut!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.420
Well, it's the truth!

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:46.460
Don't worry. It won't hurt.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:47.670
R-Right...

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.720
<i>I'll dislocate his jaw like last time.</i>

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.430
Here I go!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.790
Ow...

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:56.890
Sorry!

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.870
I got so nervous, it threw my aim off.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:00.890
R-Right...

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:03.110
One more time!

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:03.730
Yeah!

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:08.010
<i>Concentrate. I'm going to move with 
her so she can hit me in the jaw.</i>

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.040
Here I go.

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:10.360
Bring it. I'm ready—

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:11.990
<i>She got me on the other side?!</i>

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.670
Th-The left?

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:16.410
Oh, sorry. My right elbow hurt.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.070
See?! You were lying!

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.030
Last one!

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.080
All right, bring it!

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.480
<i>Recreate what happened back then.</i>

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.170
<i>For that to happen, I need to...</i>

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.700
<i>scare Miyamo.</i>

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.720
<i>All right, bring it.</i>

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.630
<i>H-Huh?</i>

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:35.890
What? What happened?

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:40.210
H-Huh? Wh-What the? U-Uh... I-I...

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.390
Um, I...

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:44.810
U-Um, how was it?

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.560
H-How was it? I, uh... What?!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.780
H-H-H-H-Huh?!

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:52.600
No, I, uh... I mean...

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:54.510
I-I...

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:55.990
Hey! What the heck's going on?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:56.730
Sorry!

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.560
You're in the way!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:05.370
I finally found you, you little shit!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:11.040
<i>That's right... Chiharu-chan 
put Manana's ass through hell,</i>

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.760
<i>so she's super pissed off!</i>

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.420
M-Mayu-nii, are you okay?

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.840
<i>Andou-san was just standing nearby...</i>

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.490
Sh-She took Mayu-nii out with one hit...

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:20.930
D-Don't tell me...

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.920
<i>That woman is actually Mayu-nii's...</i>

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.730
<i>Mayu-nii's real woman.</i>

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:27.050
Kill... Kill...

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:30.570
I'll pull your intestines out 
yer ass and pickle them...

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:35.700
Bring it on, you bitch! Come at me!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.450
Don't!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.200
She's bad news when she 
actually gets pissed off!

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:41.570
If she ever got a boyfriend 
and he cheated on her,

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:43.830
she'd chop him up and throw 
the pieces into the sea!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:47.000
<i>Shit, this isn't good. 
I won't be able to stop them.</i>

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:48.540
<i>Someone's going to die!</i>

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.220
M-Mayu-nii...

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.630
Wh-Why? I thought she knocked you out.

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:03.550
Stop.

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:06.230
If you lay a finger on my 
sister, I'll kill you.

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:09.150
<i>This isn't good... She actually 
took Andou-san out earlier.</i>

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:11.570
<i>I need to stop Manana!</i>

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.940
Oh, okay. Got it.

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:17.530
<i>Wait, why is she being so obedient?</i>

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:22.410
<i>Oh, right. I keep forgetting, 
but Andou-san was a delinquent.</i>

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:25.320
<i>He used to sit atop the school caste system.</i>

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.200
<i>Of course there's no way we,</i>

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:29.690
<i>members of the below 
average club, could beat him.</i>

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:32.960
<i>On the other hand...</i>

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.390
<i>She can be as cruel as she wants to be</i>

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.380
<i>against those who are below 
us, like grade schoolers.</i>

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:42.470
<i>Scary... She's super scary.</i>

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.350
<i>Mayu-nii's still unconscious.</i>

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:48.230
<i>He subconsciously protected me.</i>

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:51.730
Oh, there you are!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.690
Hey, we're waiting to get rung up in here.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.470
I'm sorry about that! I'll be right there!

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:59.860
What were you doing? Get it together, man.

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:06.290
All's well that ends well... I guess?

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:09.540
So basically, we're just—

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:10.540
I got it.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:15.410
If either of you were his real girlfriend, 
he wouldn't get that angry... And...

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.420
I'm so sorry about that.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:18.840
Thank you!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:22.860
He actually looks pretty 
cool working, too, huh?

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.060
Shut up! You dumbass!

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:28.770
Stop acting like you understand. Damn it.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.190
Hey, are you over it now?

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:34.480
Delinquents are scary!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.650
<i>Oh... nope.</i>

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.650
<i>Chio's School Road</i>!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.650
<b>Chio's</b>

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.650
School Road

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:40.860
I couldn't do a damn thing...

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:44.770
Uh, well, you did punch 
Andou-san in the face.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:45.430
Huh?!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.040
Though you both might not remember that.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.680
Come to think of it, I still feel 
a slight tingling sensation.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:54.540
Thinking about that makes 
me feel sort of relieved.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:57.330
<i>I guess it didn't matter who you got 
to take your frustrations out on...</i>

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.920
<b>"Andou
and
George"</b>

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.390
<b>Soft Serve Deluxe</b>

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.400
<b>Please
don't feed
the cats</b>

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.370
<b>Cat Food</b>

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.540
Andou

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.960
They got closer.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.380
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>,

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:35.530
"Chio in the Middle of 
the Night" and "Apocri."

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:36.480
Look forward to it!

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:39.980
Who are you calling a succubus?! 
But... how was I?
